lisa-design:
- User decision: ccf-bump keeps the toolchain line. KeepToolchain (internal/bump/toolchain.go; updater goToolchain, Dep DepToolchain "go toolchain", Decide skips it) runs after ApplyAll, before FollowGo, only for a plan with a Go module change and a repo whose cloned go.mod had a toolchain line. Restores newest stable patch of the new go line's minor above it (Config.GoReleases, bump.GoDev from go.dev/dl include=all), else the old toolchain if higher, else Plan.Holds gets ToolchainDropped (needs-human). Writes via modfile, then go mod tidy and verifies the line survived. A go.dev failure is a RegistryError (dry run warns).
